*.sqlite

# The model-state history DB (the maturity curve over time). Ignored ON PURPOSE and
# EXPLICITLY, not by inheriting the blanket *.db rule above: one ~218 KB binary blob per
# rebuild would be undiffable and unmergeable, and two parallel sessions committing it
# would conflict irreconcilably (ADR-008, one writer at a time).
# ⚠ It is NOT reconstructible — it is the only copy of the time series. Its durable,
# git-friendly counterpart is brain_v2/capability_model/maturity_history.jsonl (one ~200 B
# line per run), which IS versioned. Back the .db up off-disk before touching this rule.
brain_v2/model_state/*.db

*.tflite
*.pb
*.wasm

